<div class="aboutUs">
    <h1 class="aboutUsHeader">About Us</h1>
    <p class="aboutUsText">
        I am a CS student who had an idea and decided to try and bring it to life.
        I am a born-again Christian. I believe Jesus is the Son of 
        God who came to the world and through His death, paid for our sins and 
        gifted those who believe in Him eternal life. <br>
        <br>
        The idea behind the website is to work together to create a page to 
        find information on different topics and share prayer requests so 
        we can learn together and support each other. The page is not perfect 
        and probably far from it, so if you have an idea of how to improve 
        it, I'd love to hear it.
        <br>
    </p>
</div>

